      "description": "Watch Hibernian vs Shkendija highlights and goals from UEFA Europa Conference League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 6, 2026. High stakes in European competition The atmosphere at the stadium was electric as Hibernian hosted Shkendija for their crucial UEFA Conference League match on 6 August 2026. With European ambitions on the line, both sides prepared for a grueling physical and tactical battle. Second-half drama erupts Following a closely contested opening period, the game ignited in the second half. Discipline became an issue, with Owen Elding and Miguel Chaiwa both entering the referee’s book as the match intensified. The deadlock was finally broken in the 74th minute when Owen Elding fired home to give Hibernian the lead. The joy was short-lived, however, as Marko Gjorgjievski capitalized on the momentum shift to equalize for Shkendija just two minutes later. Late heroics secure the win As the clock ticked toward full time, it looked as though the points might be shared. Deep in the final minute of regulation, Warren O'Hora surged forward to score the decisive goal, sending the home supporters into a frenzy. A late yellow card for Vane Krstevski underlined the desperation of the visitors, but Hibernian held firm through the stoppage time to claim a hard-fought and memorable victory."
